      "tags": ["database", "im-core", "group-chat", "messaging"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:FoxChat.sql:llm_chat_msg",
      "type": "table",
      "name": "llm_chat_msg",
      "filePath": "FoxChat.sql",
      "lineRange": [104, 113],
      "summary": "AI 对话消息表，记录 LLM 聊天消息的发送者、内容、状态（发送/存入 DB/存入 RAG）、关联模型和是否为 AI 生成消息。",
      "tags": ["database", "ai-memory", "llm-chat"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:FoxChat.sql:llm_user",
      "type": "table",
