      "tags": ["database", "ai-memory", "rag", "file-management"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:FoxChat.sql:users",
      "type": "table",
      "name": "users",
      "filePath": "FoxChat.sql",
      "lineRange": [160, 172],
      "summary": "用户核心信息表，存储用户名、加密密码、头像、昵称、二维码、客户端 ID 和邮箱，用户名唯一索引。",
      "tags": ["database", "im-core", "user-auth"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "table:FoxChat.sql:llm_config",
      "type": "table",
      "name": "llm_config",
      "filePath": "FoxChat.sql",
      "lineRange": [178, 192],
      "summary": "LLM 模型配置表，按 AI 伙伴和场景类型（chat/memory/summary/extraction/emotion）存储模型名称、API Key、服务地址、温度参数和输出格式等配置，支持默认配置标记。",
      "tags": ["database", "ai-memory", "llm-config", "multi-model"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "通过 llm_id + scenario 唯一索引实现同一 AI 伙伴按场景使用不同模型的灵活配置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:README.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "README.md",
      "filePath": "README.md",
      "summary": "FoxChat 项目主文档，涵盖项目定位、AI 多阶段记忆架构设计（分层记忆、记忆流水线）、Java IM 核心架构、通信协议、技术栈、快速启动指南和项目结构说明。",
      "tags": ["documentation", "entry-point", "architecture", "ai-memory"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "包含详细的 ASCII 架构图和二进制协议格式说明，是理解项目整体设计的核心文档。"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:项目介绍.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "项目介绍.md",
      "filePath": "项目介绍.md",
      "summary": "项目简介文档，概述 FoxChat 作为 AI 驱动智能 IM 系统的技术栈和五大核心亮点：LangGraph DAG 推理编排、多阶段混合 RAG 检索、分层认知记忆架构、自研二进制通信协议和跨语言 gRPC 流式推理。",
      "tags": ["documentation", "overview", "ai-memory", "architecture"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
